{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Pippins\n🎲 Diamond-shaped Darkner based on a die; common enemy of the TV World (Ch.3).","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pippins_overworld_TV_show.gif","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Mike**\nBattat (Small Mike), one of the three impostors posing as Mike, is actually a green Pippins — the only one of that color in the whole game.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nThey're the common enemy of the TV World, the realm Tenna rules.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_mike.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":177},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":420,"y":-470,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":-580,"y":164,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"3","text":"**Ramb**\nWhen Ramb is turned to stone at his stand in the Green Room, a nearby Pippins remarks without compassion that he \"never really fit in\" in the TV World, unlike the Pippins, who do come from Card Kingdom. [[Ramb]]"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","x":-880,"y":190,"width":190,"height":120,"file":"Sprites/Pippins_screenshot_Ramb_outcast.png"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":320,"y":380,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**The forged S rank**\nA Pippins in the red carpet hallway sells a fake S rank for 1500 POINTs, letting you skip the actual rank requirement to access the corresponding changing room."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","x":640,"y":410,"width":190,"height":120,"file":"Sprites/Pippins_screenshot_key_scam.png"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_ramb_tenna","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}